      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 / POST /v1/withdrawals（规划）\n报价/用户/网络/资产/收款人/金额\nTLS/mTLS + HTTP 验签 + 新 nonce\n固定 Idempotency-Key / external_order_id\n金额为资产最小单位整数字符串",
      "originalText": "1 / POST /v1/withdrawals（规划）\n报价/用户/网络/资产/收款人/金额\nTLS/mTLS + HTTP 验签 + 新 nonce\n固定 Idempotency-Key / external_order_id\n金额为资产最小单位整数字符串",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-04-withdrawal-api",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
