      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 / 受限提现签名器（规划）\n先持久 AUTHORIZATION_POSSIBLE\n重载订单、批准、域、epoch 并复核\nWITHDRAWAL_SIGNER 签精确 Permit\n高于 councilThreshold 另需 Council",
      "originalText": "4 / 受限提现签名器（规划）\n先持久 AUTHORIZATION_POSSIBLE\n重载订单、批准、域、epoch 并复核\nWITHDRAWAL_SIGNER 签精确 Permit\n高于 councilThreshold 另需 Council",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-04-withdrawal-authorize",
      "autoResize": false,
