      "text": "9 / 规范链最终结果（规划）\n收据 + WithdrawalExecuted\nrequestStatus(requestId) = Executed\n校验 token / to / amount / approval\n未知或重组保留用户 Hold",
      "originalText": "9 / 规范链最终结果（规划）\n收据 + WithdrawalExecuted\nrequestStatus(requestId) = Executed\n校验 token / to / amount / approval\n未知或重组保留用户 Hold",
