      "text": "12 / 查询与 Webhook（规划）\nGET /v1/withdrawals/{id}\nPOST 202 只表示受理/冻结\nstable eventId；至少一次投递\n租户校验平台签名并事务去重",
      "originalText": "12 / 查询与 Webhook（规划）\nGET /v1/withdrawals/{id}\nPOST 202 只表示受理/冻结\nstable eventId；至少一次投递\n租户校验平台签名并事务去重",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-04-withdrawal-notify",
      "autoResize": false,
