    {
      "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2133287,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note0-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note0-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 265.4,
      "y": 1467.5,
      "width": 709.2,
      "height": 90.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2616845,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "失败/超时：txHash 丢失、RPC 查不到、外层 revert、换 Relayer 均不能直接退款。\n同一 Treasury 的同一经济订单使用同 requestId；失败授权可能仍可再次提交。\n取消与付款竞争以最终链状态为准，详见 05。\n合约不会识别不同 requestId 其实是同一商户订单，长期业务唯一性必须由后端保障。",
      "originalText": "失败/超时：txHash 丢失、RPC 查不到、外层 revert、换 Relayer 均不能直接退款。\n同一 Treasury 的同一经济订单使用同 requestId；失败授权可能仍可再次提交。\n取消与付款竞争以最终链状态为准，详见 05。\n合约不会识别不同 requestId 其实是同一商户订单，长期业务唯一性必须由后端保障。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2134258,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note1-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1479.35,
      "y": 1467.5,
      "width": 681.3,
      "height": 90.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2617816,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "资金上限：普通付款后余额 ≥ totalReserve + Treasury safetyFloor。\n后端另扣独立在途物理预留，不能用账面 available 替代流动性。\n高额判断为 amount > councilThreshold；Council 为独立 ERC-1271 多签。\nroutesPaused 不阻断直接外部提现；要停止提现须用 RiskRegistry 或收紧额度。",
      "originalText": "资金上限：普通付款后余额 ≥ totalReserve + Treasury safetyFloor。\n后端另扣独立在途物理预留，不能用账面 available 替代流动性。\n高额判断为 amount > councilThreshold；Council 为独立 ERC-1271 多签。\nroutesPaused 不阻断直接外部提现；要停止提现须用 RiskRegistry 或收紧额度。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-04-withdrawal-note2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
